{"parse": {"title": "AR-6", "pageid": 89276, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-5\" title=\"AR-5\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-6</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-7\" title=\"AR-7\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">6</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BA.AF.E7.B2.B9.E7.9A.84.E6.95.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"纯粹的数\">纯粹的数</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 纯粹的数</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Just Numbers</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>题目前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>题目后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的光景似乎与过去别无二致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海边的风总是带着咸味，裹挟着砂砾涌来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个身影一前一后，靠牵起的手紧紧连缀着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人在意从传道会溜走的孩童。只要足够小心，不被抓住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>好啦，这个地方就不错，比我家以前的院子大多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你玩过跳房子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着手指望去，沙地上有几道用贝壳划出的线条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们组成了稚拙但规整的方格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>从这儿跳到——这儿，千万不要踩到边界线，也不要让贝壳压到线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我在岛外面总玩这个。它和捉迷藏之类的不同，即使只有你一个，也能玩下去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>听上去真的很不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不过，地面的线条毫无规律，只是被随便摆放在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>或许我得再玩一会儿才能明白它的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一小捧砂砾被踢了起来。37愉快地挪动脚步，转了个圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>为什么我们只能跳方形的格子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>把九点圆放进这个游戏里应该也很棒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>有四个内切圆、十二个旁切圆会与它相切，如果只在切点上跳跃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把自己想到的东西都摆出来与朋友分享。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>认真，执着，试图在讨论与交流中说明她所见的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像在沙滩上捡拾细碎闪亮的砾石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一如今日。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你总是把简单的东西变复杂，210。休只是让我们完成这些游戏——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>什么？我当然知道教典说：“不把问题分为三个方面的人无法做到真正的明智。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可这不足以成为你要推进三人一组的竞技比赛的论据！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记忆中的身影与眼前的光景重合，似乎时日未曾流逝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩少见的笑容让同伴好奇地凑了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚，你在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>是一些让你开心的事儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我在想，“流溢”发生后，大家好像很少像这样聚在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>6成为了6，你也接手了母亲的研究，210忙着他自己的交际与证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>连刚才那样的讨论几乎都不再发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但时隔这么久，你也还是如此坚定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>好像从不曾变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔？也许你没有注意到，但我确实改变了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高高举起手，37比划着从地面到头顶的距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>和过去相比，我长高了不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我的头发也更长，更难打理了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你帮我梳头的时间也变久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不是这些看得到的改变……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>好吧，我不太明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>比起这个——我需要你的帮助，苏菲亚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>只剩最后两道题了，我们离答案仅差一粒小石子的距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我希望和你一块儿完成它。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37合上笔记本，她确信自己已经体验了其中每一个细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而结果是显明的，从一开始，大家就可以在纸面上看出这些数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>6333434533。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个能被41整除的合数，其最大的质因数是154474013。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果把它视作数列，那这是一个仅由3、4、5、6构成的简单组合。3出现了6次，4出现了2次，5和6各出现了1次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可无论是作为数，还是数列，我都感觉自己少看了一些东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>休标注的几个图形一定有用处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我只是暂时没有想到这些小点指的是什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37指向笔记本上的一滴墨痕。它不偏不倚地落在六边形的正下方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>也许只是无意弄上去的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但靠后的这道题下边也有，瞧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我知道有时候为了方便，他们会给无限循环小数里头不断重复的数字打上点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>那个点在上，这个点却标在下方——也许苏菲亚的父亲认为6其实相当具有局限性？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这段话毫无道理，不是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>知道幽默感为何物对你也没什么坏处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他耸了耸肩，对37的反驳不甚在意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我承认，起初我把休的标记想得太过复杂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>毕竟它们的特性太多，很容易扰乱思考方向……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>听听你之前对我的指教：不必使简单的东西复杂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>也许这些符号里什么深意都没有——只是你使它复杂化了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不，绝对不会，我很确定！休一定不是随便做这些标记的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你瞧，只有答案是数字3的题目边上画着这种图案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这不过是和三角形个数有关的小谜题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>父亲的确很喜欢各种几何形状，我认为37的想法有道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>获得支持的37得意地继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我本以为，如果我实际体验了这个游戏，就能明白这些标记和数列的含义……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但现在我还是不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>一定是哪里缺失了一环，因为我并不了解休。如果是苏菲亚来的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>哦，所以结论是，游戏里并没有你坚持的什么秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>看来我要赢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你太着急了，210！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>教典说过，学神先不语。应当保持沉默，认真听取他人的发言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我还没说完就被不停地打断！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>教典也说过，要聆听风吹动的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>积极聆听万物的声音，对你的思考有好处。——难道我不算万物之一吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>想想你的论点——简单的游戏足以蕴含最美妙的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>而你现在认为，你寻不得这样的智慧，是因为你不够了解休。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——瞧瞧，37。我甚至懒得踢翻你的城堡，因为它已经是一摊流沙了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210讥讽地摇了摇头，似乎结论已经不言而喻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37并不相让，抱起手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我完全不懂你在说什么！因为你的话空洞无物，只有修辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>别着急，我正要解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>美妙的智慧应该适用于每个人，你现在却要借助私人关系来勘破真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>是的，也许这个数列确有深意。也许它的深意，不过是休给他女儿的一句家书。毕竟它从来不是什么公理集，只是一个私人笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——这串数字只会对休和苏菲亚有意义，那你知道又有什么用呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>教典说：不要轻易向别人伸出右手。这话说的是我们应管好自己的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>而我们的赫尔墨斯之星则热衷于拿走他人的证明，再把它们随意抛掷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你的母亲留下的内容还不够你打发时间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210毫不掩饰话语中的讥讽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他的对手也有自己的坚持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不，这句话的含义是，我们不要轻易将智慧和知识传达给不懂欣赏的人，你歪曲了它的原意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>进入神庙后，不可回头——在追求真理的道路上，一知半解比一无所知更糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>既然我已经开始探寻这个问题，就不应中途停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>而且，数的意义并不是任何一个人规定的！因为数就只是在那里，与时间、地域以及我们是怎样的人都无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它并不是谁的私有物！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>如果我们都未曾得到这串数字，又怎么能断言它的性质呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>交谈的天平再次向无止境的辩驳倾斜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>唔，这下糟了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除错师有些困恼地夹在二人中间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调停纷争是她的长处，可这更像是有理有据的辩经。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许她应该就此离去，留这二人穷尽真理，毕竟这更加符合学派的作风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在她思索时，37猛地转过头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>既然这样，我们就交给苏菲亚来裁决吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>找出笔记里的秘密，看看究竟我们谁正确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我同意，让除错师检验问题的对错，让每个人做自己该做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……唉，还是这样了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无奈地扶着额头，为自己片刻的犹豫有些后悔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但要拒绝友人期待的目光也并非易事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>好吧，我会用心判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>首先，让我把这个游戏全部回顾一遍……</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-6"}}